|-----------|-------|---------|-----------------|
| In-slot `n_past` prefix | Single slot | Automatic | ✅ Yes |
| `server_prompt_cache` (RAM) | Cross-slot | `--cache-ram` | ✅ Yes (no chunk shift) |
